catflow 0.8
1. Read Audio           interview.m4a
2. Transcribe           Whisper Large v3; lang=en
3. Rewrite              Qwen3 8B; "Remove filler words; keep meaning and
                        speaker turns"
4. Draft                Qwen3 8B; "1,000-word article from this interview,
                        quotes verbatim"
5. Critique             Ministral 3B; "quotes verbatim? faithful?
                        engaging?"
6. Gate                 Ministral 3B; "Real weaknesses left? tags: fix,
                        ship"; max_visits=2; on_budget=ship
   -> { fix: 7 | ship: 8 }
7. Revise       (4,5)   Qwen3 8B
   -> 5
8. Save Text            article.md
